     "text": [
      "I’m not able to create or display images directly here. However, I can help you come up with a detailed description or a prompt that you could paste into an AI‑image generator (like DALL·E, Midjourney, Stable Diffusion, etc.) to produce the image you have in mind. Let me know what you’d like to see—color scheme, subject, style, mood, and any other details—and I’ll craft a prompt for you!\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from dotenv import load_dotenv\n",
    "load_dotenv()\n",
    "\n",
    "from langchain_groq import ChatGroq\n",
    "llm = ChatGroq(model = \"openai/gpt-oss-20b\")\n",
    "response = llm.invoke(\"Genrate one image\")\n",
    "print(response.content)"
   ]
  }
